Bulwark Lite is the static edition of Bulwark Webmail, a browser-based
JMAP client designed for Stalwart Mail Server. It provides mail, calendar,
contacts, files, multiple accounts, themes, and password/TOTP login.

This port installs upstream's prebuilt static client for an existing web
server. It does not require Node.js or a local mail server. The browser
connects directly to a JMAP server, which must permit the webmail origin
through CORS when hosted separately.

Lite omits the full edition's admin console, plugins, settings sync,
OAuth/OIDC configuration, office editing, and web push notifications.
